 "sentences": [
  "This galaxy hides a chaotic secret.",
  "NGC 4698 sits 55 million light-years away in the Virgo Cluster.",
  "Unlike typical spirals, its arms hover in a ring-like structure around the perimeter.",
  "The center contains a supermassive black hole that is actively growing.",
  "Even weirder, its central bulge extends at a right angle to the disk.",
  "Internal stars rotate perpendicular to everything else."
